      <th>PLONK (SNARK)</th>
      <th>zk-STARK</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><strong>可信设置</strong></td>
      <td>电路特定，需MPC仪式[^78^]</td>
